                "**Stay on ECC** – with extended maintenance until 2030, or with a third-party maintenance provider. Sensible when a decision is still open or a merger is coming. Risk: every year without a decision makes the later project bigger, and the SAP specialists who know ECC get rarer and more expensive.",
